If you have GCC installed:
gcc src/main.c -o restaurant

~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

On Windows, run restaurant.exe.

## How to Run

1. Clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Compile the source code:

   gcc src/main.c -o restaurant

4. Run the program:

   ./restaurant

   On Windows, run restaurant.exe.


On Linux/macOS:
./restaurant
